More information Billiards is quickly seen by many people as a fun pub game, but it does require some insight and technique, especially at the top level!
Carom billiards involves serious skill, often involving angles and trick shots. If you already know pool, carom is the next step!
1.2 Determine who starts
2.1 Control the cue and your attitude
