Do you know all the types and advantages of Venetian blinds?
Knowing this already, we can say that we are facing one of the most popular blind styles all over the world. Hence, with them our decoration will always have a great success.
Bamboo Venetian Blinds: They are one of the most ecological options that we must take into account, although yes, they still have the finish and the advantages of wood.
Venetian blinds with vertical slats: Although it is true that we are used to seeing how this type of blinds take them horizontally, you also have the opposite side. Because verticality adds originality to an idea like this.
If the window has a Venetian blind drawer, then we must measure this first and then we will increase the necessary centimeters so that the window is also covered by the Venetian blind itself. Once you have the measurements and your Venetian blind at home, you just have to assemble it in a simple way.
Advantages of this type of blinds that you should know
In addition to regulating the amount of light you want to pass through them, since only you have the last word. Cleaning is also easier than if we think about traditional curtains and since it is not textile, we can forget about mites forever.
