If you find yourself constantly weighing yourself to keep the ideal weight, how about weighing your food instead?
The instructions for both the scale and app are simple. All you have to do is place the food you wish to weigh on the scale, input what food (cuisine type/restaurant/components) it is, and watch the numbers separate and add up.
The app will automatically pull nutritional information on your behalf, and you can teach the app to recognise your routine and track your intake everyday. Other features of the app include a history section that can be used to keep track of eating habits over time, and backup options.
