Known as “The Smart Axiata Digital Innovation Fund”, this latest initiative by Cambodia’s leading mobile telecommunications company is a 5 million USD venture capital fund for Cambodian-based digital service companies and startups.
As such, this fund seeks to invest in ideas and businesses in the digital ecosystem to spark the development of a robust digital economy that will ultimately help Cambodia grow as a country.
Startup teams will also be evaluated based on a combination of different factors such as: the merit and feasibility of the business model, market attractiveness, technical competence, persistence, intelligence, problem-solving, passion and drive for success.
