This year’s ICT Awards saw applicants participating in six different categories: the Public Sector, Private Sector, CSR, Digital Content, Startup Company, and Research and Development. The applicants came from different backgrounds, ranging from education and health to human resource and business applications.
All applicants had to carry out a 15-minute presentation in front of the judging panel. Winners were chosen based on their innovation for problem solving, along with the public value, quality and reliability of their business.
Public Sector: Sand Dredging Management System, Ministry of Mines and Energy
The Cambodia ICT Awards hopes to contribute in promoting innovation in ICT industries. With aims to bring Cambodian ICT companies to regional and international competitions such as the ASEAN ICT Awards, the Cambodia ICT Awards is in line with the Ministry of Posts and Telecommunications’ Cambodia ICT Master Plan 2020 and the ICT Development Policy 2020.
