Within these 5 hours of sitting in the taxi, you cannot do anything; you can only just sit in the car. So I took that time to take a survey with the taxi driver, I asked him what does he think if we published his profile to the website and everyone can contact him directly.
Right now we have eight members, within this 8 members, we are divided into different teams. We have the management team, I.T team, media team, and even a sales & marketing team.
Talking about vision, bookmebus wants to be the first choice of both travellers and in the business in the next five years. We want to provide both operators and travellers with the most cost-effective and accessible way of making travel bookings in every corner of Cambodia.
Yes, they knew, they knew what e-payment was, but the next question is, “Do you have an account? To pay online?”
